ido alrededor, tienes que hacerlo realmente bien, tienes que ser impresionante»— es el que han seguido, de maneras distintas, artistas como Grimes —la canadiense Claire Boucher—, Banks, Little Boots o Lorde, que trabajan de manera natural con el material de más fácil acceso —el portátil como…"},{"book":"Loops 1 y 2. Una historia de la música electrónica","author":"Javier Blánquez (ed.)","page":351,"text":"…es la de aquellas figuras que aceptan con todas sus consecuencias la modernidad que se enmarca en la intersección entre rave, R&B y pop adolescente. Grimes, por ejemplo, se acerca sin tapujos al mainstream con la misma pericia que los compositores de hits —su facilidad para hacer melodías perfectas como…"}],"podcast":[{"kind":"podcast","title":"AI Voice Usage Offer (April 2023)","body":"In April 2023, Grimes extended an offer, stating that anyone could use her voice in their AI creations. In return, she requested 50% of any profits generated by the new songs that utilized her AI-cloned voice, setting a precedent for artist compensation in the era of AI. \"In April 2023 she made an offer. Anyone can use her voice in their AI creations in return for 50% of any profits generated by the new song.\"","year":2023,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"The History and Future of AI in Music","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QFtS8fl553Y"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Canadian Artist","body":"Grimes is a Canadian artist noted for her contributions to the dreamy music scene in the 21st century.","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"Dreampop - A History","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kFLMkvJAaUY"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Spectral Influence of Witchhouse","body":"Grimes is an artist whose work clearly showed the spectral influence of Witchhouse, demonstrating how the genre's aesthetic extended into other contemporary music. \"Se podía apreciar en artistas como Grimes, 